Etetőcumi Canpol babies Natural Shape 12 hó+, 2 db:





	The Canpol babies Natural Shape teat for babies from 12 months respects their natural sucking rhythm and is a suitable choice for combining breastfeeding with bottle feeding or for feeding with expressed milk. Developed in collaboration with a neurologopedist, the dual-zone teat with DuoFlex technology mimics the behaviour of the breast during feeding – milk only flows when the baby is actively sucking, the flexible tip copies the movement of the nipple, and the wide, stable base supports the natural 'fish-mouth' lip position. This helps the baby to suck smoothly without interruption or swallowing excessive air, which helps reduce the risk of colic and tummy ache. The Canpol babies Natural Shape teat is made of high-quality, BPA-free silicone with a texture that mimics the mother's nipple. The teat is compatible with Canpol babies Natural Shape bottles (150ml, 260ml or 330ml).&nbsp;


















